OL,3,ASome BBC channels and radio stations
OL,4,Amay well have to close, director
OL,5,Ageneral says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC's financial situation and
OL,8,Fchanging audience habits "may well
OL,9,Fmean" some channels and radio stations
OL,10,Fhave to close so resources can be
OL,11,Finvested in on-demand services, its
OL,12,Fdirector general has said.
OL,14,FAs the BBC seeks #500m savings, Matt
OL,15,FBrittin told BBC One's Sunday With
OL,16,FLaura Kuenssberg that "we wouldn't
OL,17,Fguarantee any programme or any channel
OL,18,Fwill exist forever".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790349974
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASome BBC channels and radio stations
OL,4,Amay well have to close, director
OL,5,Ageneral says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said: "The tight financial situation
OL,8,Fmeans that we're having to look at some
OL,9,Fof those decisions a bit sooner than we
OL,10,Fmight like."
OL,12,FAudience behaviour is also rapidly
OL,13,Fchanging, he said. "If most of an
OL,14,Faudience is getting things on demand,
OL,15,Fwe have to look at the value and the
OL,16,Fcost of all of those different
OL,17,Fservices."
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
